{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262286-what-websites-do-you-use-for-inspiration-and-ideas","id":1262286,"title":"What websites do you use for inspiration and ideas?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-22T21:00:59-07:00","id":1262286,"title":"What websites do you use for inspiration and ideas?","content":"Ex. Pininterest or Tumblr<br /> <br /> Post links","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-22T21:15:20-07:00","id":1262288,"title":"","content":"Oddly, I end up using wikipedia quite a lot.<br /> As an example link, I've used this list for inspiration when making artifacts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_mythological_objects\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Joseph_Alanen_-_The_Forging_of_the_Sampo.jpg/1280px-Joseph_Alanen_-_The_Forging_of_the_Sampo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_mythological_objects\" target=\"_blank\"> List of mythological objects - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_mythological_objects\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_mythological_objects </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T21:56:11-07:00","id":1262474,"title":"","content":"I have my pinterest and deviantart links in my sig. Other than that, I find that videos about history and mythology make for great plot fodder (obviously book too, but you asked for links), so things like Extra History and Overtly Sarcastic Productions on youtube are really good stuff to prowl throught.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T06:01:58-07:00","id":1262501,"title":"","content":"r/askhistorians","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-24T07:23:43-07:00","id":1262522,"title":"","content":"I'm a pretty serious Pinterest user but augment it with google image search in case a particular image belongs to a well known property that could ultimately prove too recognisable.<br /> <br /> For Exalted, I mostly use it to collect a series of images appropriate to a character or location and see what gets recommended, often it's crap or things you already had but occasionally it strikes gold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T02:21:04-07:00","id":1262640,"title":"","content":"I use Google images as well, it works well for visualisations of people, places and monsters. (Though it's much better for some stuff than others; there's much better fantasy art for male characters than female ones, unless you're doing an erpg, which I'm not).<br /> <br /> Also, I got into the habit of doing write-ups of the session afterwards and emailing them to my players (we play weekly but alternate 4 games, so there's 4 weeks between each game. Thus we need a reminder). So I find suitable art of places and people, mostly from Google images, and include them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T04:56:58-07:00","id":1262657,"title":"","content":"That's actually part of the appeal of Pinterest for me, I use a lot of female characters so the stricter standards of content helps filter out a lot of the noise I'd be dealing with on sites like google image search or deviant art.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T05:59:20-07:00","id":1262662,"title":"","content":"One of my friends has a Pinterest board for each of her characters, and of locations for her game, it seems to work well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-26T05:53:26-07:00","id":1262833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262286-what-websites-do-you-use-for-inspiration-and-ideas?p=1262522#post1262522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a pretty serious Pinterest user but augment it with google image search in case a particular image belongs to a well known property that could ultimately prove too recognisable.<br /> <br /> For Exalted, I mostly use it to collect a series of images appropriate to a character or location and see what gets recommended, often it's crap or things you already had but occasionally it strikes gold.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dont know if you've ever posted a link to your pinterest board, but I'd be very interested in that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-26T09:34:43-07:00","id":1262886,"title":"","content":"Google image search, combined with numerous roleplay sessions. A lot of things I introduced in previous games as minor side details or plot points end up forming the basis of other ideas further down the road.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-27T08:35:24-07:00","id":1263064,"title":"","content":"Sometimes I just search for some unusual fantasy or science fiction settings and I explore their wikis, reviews and any other fan contents I can find on the internet.<br /> Most of the time I do it just for fun, the same way I was reading mythologies encyclopedia when I was younger, but sometimes I really find cool ideas for my rpg campaigns or interesting point of views about how people see those settings elements.<br /> Since my stories are long, I usually take a 3 weeks pause between each stories when I ask questions and suggestions from my players about what they want for their characters and the campaign now and what novels, comics and movies they can recommand me for inspiration. Then I read their plot (or read the novels, the comics or see the movies when I have a sufficient amount of free time) and look at things like e-commerce websites or movie and novel review websites, seeking other ideas in stories with plot similarities and their reviews.<br /> <br /> And that's all I do when I'm not doing what was said before. ^^<br /> It could've been shorter and more nuanced, but my english is lacking. &gt;&lt;<br /> <br /> EDIT: I just remembered. It's rare, but sometimes I look in this site (<a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/\" target=\"_blank\">https://tvtropes.org/</a>) and I'm like &quot;m'okay, is there an interesting story clich\u00e9 I didn't think about when I was working on this new setting ?&quot; When I'm exploring this site my imagination does really strange things. X)<br /> <br /> I don't think what I'm saying really is interesting, but I surely lack shame when I'm not talking about how bad I am at doing something. X)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23607,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23607-roseplancton","user":"RosePlancton","date":". 10-27-2018, 11:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23607-roseplancton","name":"RosePlancton","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-05T20:50:13-08:00","id":1264871,"title":"","content":"Random links:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://arcana.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <im